sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User as Usuario
    participant CF as CloudFront
    participant WAF as AWS WAF
    participant WR as Waiting Room<br/>Admission Service
    participant DB as DynamoDB<br/>Queue State
    participant Checkout as Checkout API<br/>ECS/Fargate

    User->>CF: GET /events/{eventId}
    CF->>WAF: Request

    WAF->>WAF: Validar IP / bot / rate limits

    alt Request permitido
        WAF->>WR: Check admission status
    else Request bloqueado
        WAF-->>User: HTTP 403
    end

    WR->>DB: Get/Create queue entry
    DB-->>WR: Position + status

    alt Usuario aún no admitido

        WR-->>CF: WAITING + queueToken
        CF-->>User: Waiting Room + posición

        loop Polling cada N segundos
            User->>CF: GET /waiting-room/status
            CF->>WR: Validate queueToken
            WR->>DB: Get queue status
            DB-->>WR: Position / admitted

            alt Capacidad disponible
                WR->>DB: Mark user ADMITTED
                WR-->>CF: Admission token
                CF-->>User: Redirect /checkout
            else Capacidad ocupada
                WR-->>CF: Still waiting
                CF-->>User: Position updated
            end
        end

    else Usuario ya admitido

        WR-->>CF: Admission token
        CF-->>User: Redirect /checkout

    end

    User->>CF: GET /checkout
    CF->>WAF: Validate request
    WAF->>Checkout: Forward request

    Checkout->>Checkout: Validate admission token
    Checkout-->>User: Checkout disponible
